caption: Shared Psi purchase bands
engine-rule: shared-psi-purchase-bands

Basic

No Innate Attack, Affliction, or Binding.

Buffs require at least -60% in limitations.

Other abilities require at least -30%.

An ability with a base cost above 25 may not be purchased above one level. No trait with a base cost above 75 is legal; a trait with a base cost exactly 75 must meet the -60% limitation requirement.

Advanced

Attacks are permitted.

Traits normally require at least -20%.

Traits over 75 base points normally require at least -40%.

No trait with base cost over 100.

Master

Any appropriate trait may be purchased.

Only the Origin modifier is universally required.

SPAA Enhanced becomes available.
